pack` in this repo, then `dsh"},{"id":"p9s4","text":" plugin --profile web add ./dsh-budget-<version>.tgz`.\n- **uninstall**: `dsh plugin --profile web re"},{"id":"p9s5","text":" web add ./dsh-budget-<version>.tgz`.\n- **uninstall**: `dsh plugin --profile web remove dsh-budget`."},{"id":"p10s1","text":"> If pnpm reports `ERR_PNPM_IGNORED_BUILDS` for this package (esbuild's harmless platform-binary val"},{"id":"p10s2","text":"idation), add `allowBuilds: { esbuild: true }` to your `pnpm-workspace.yaml` — the `dsh` CLI prints "},{"id":"p10s3","text":"owBuilds: { esbuild: true }` to your `pnpm-workspace.yaml` — the `dsh` CLI prints the exact snippet."},{"id":"p11s1","text":"## ⭐ 如果它帮到了你"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"这个插件是 DSH 插件家族的一员（95 个，全部 Apache-2.0）。如果你在用，**给个 star** —— 它不会解锁任何功能，但会让下一个人在搜索里更容易找到它。"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"*English:* part of a 95 plugin family for DeepSeek Harness. If it is useful, **a star helps the next"},{"id":"p13s2","text":" person find it** — nothing is gated behind it."},{"id":"p14s1","text":"## What is dsh-budget?"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"Cost governance for DeepSeek Harness: budgets, carbon, and latency in one panel."},{"id":"p16s1","text":"Know what every session costs — before it costs you."},{"id":"p17s1","text":"*Structure: usage arrives after the fact on `session/event`; `checkBudgets` walks session → daily → "},{"id":"p17s2","text":"monthly; the over-limit disposal ends on the `llm/stream` seam, where a blocked scope short-circuits"},{"id":"p17s3","text":" the next call — a passed call returns as the next usage sample. The examples below use the real com"},{"id":"p17s4","text":" — a passed call returns as the next usage sample. The examples below use the real command surface.*"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"## Maintenance status: 🧊 FROZEN"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"> **Frozen on 2026-10-05. No new features.** This package still works, and it is not retired — but i"},{"id":"p19s2","text":"t no longer receives feature work. Only a genuine breakage will be fixed."},{"id":"p20s1","text":"Maintainers treat this capability as one where **the ecosystem has converged on a more widely adopte"},{"id":"p20s2","text":"d implementation**, so effort has moved elsewhere. The comparison below was measured on 2026-10-05 a"},{"id":"p20s3","text":"nd is recorded so nobody has to redo it."},{"id":"p21s1","text":"| | package | weekly downloads |"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"| **this package** | `dsh-budget` | 1,079 |\n| more widely adopted implementation | `dsh-cost-meter` "},{"id":"p22s2","text":"| **33,526** |\n| another alternative | `dsh-usage-stats` | not measured |\n| another alternative | `@"},{"id":"p22s3","text":"dougen/dsh-deepseek-usage` | 6,019 |"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"**Why it is the mainstream choice.** `dsh-cost-meter` provides a 170+ model price catalog with autom"},{"id":"p23s2","text":"atic matching, and Coding-Plan quota lookup for 11 providers."},{"id":"p24s1","text":"[该节后续省略]"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"## Compatibility"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"| Surface | Status |"},{"id":"p27s1","text":"| Harness | DeepSeek Harness `dsh-v0.2.1-alpha.1` (GitHub tag, adapted 2026-09-24; peer range `>=0.1"},{"id":"p27s2","text":".2-rc.1 <0.2.0 || >=0.1.5-alpha.1 <0.2.0 || >=0.1.6-0 <0.2.0 || >=0.1.7-0 <0.2.0`): the alpha.2 cata"},{"id":"p27s3","text":"log prices are built into the price table and unknown models surface as unpriced instead of a fabric"},{"id":"p27s4","text":"ated estimate; the audit gate keeps suppressing `budget/alert`/`budget/block` appends (fail-closed s"},{"id":"p27s5","text":"ession event vocabulary). Verified 2026-09-24 by the two-ruler typecheck chain and the full local ga"},{"id":"p27s6","text":"te; the browser-panel items stay 人工·未测即未完成 (maintainer manual checklist). |"},{"id":"p28s1","text":"| Audit events | Written on harnesses before `0.1.2-rc.1`; suppressed with a logged degradation reas"},{"id":"p28s2","text":"on on `0.1.2-rc.1` and later (fail-closed session event vocabulary, no external registration surface"},{"id":"p28s3","text":") || Node | `^22.19.0 \\|\\| >=24.0.0` |\n| Surfaces | Host + Web client (Settings budget tab); `/budge"},{"id":"p28s4","text":"`^22.19.0 \\|\\| >=24.0.0` |\n| Surfaces | Host + Web client (Settings budget tab); `/budget` command |"},{"id":"p29s1","text":"## What you get"},{"id":"p30s1","text":"`dsh-budget` turns the session event stream into a four-in-one cost governance loop:"},{"id":"p31s1","text":"- **Aggregated metering** — tokens (uncached input / output / cache read / cache write), estimated U"},{"id":"p31s2","text":"SD cost, and carbon footprint per model, session, and day, priced through a built-in USD-per-1M tabl"},{"id":"p31s3","text":"e merged with your `config.prices`.\n- **Budget governance** — session/daily/monthly caps; a warn-rat"},{"id":"p31s4","text":"io threshold alert (webhook POST + desktop-notification flag) and three over-limit policies: `alert`"},{"id":"p31s5","text":" (notify only), `block` (short-circuit new model requests until the user lifts the block), `degrade`"},{"id":"p31s6","text":" (block with corrective guidance naming the cheaper model from your `degradation` map).\n- **Carbon &"},{"id":"p31s7","text":" latency** — token→carbon bridge (tokens × kWh/token × PUE × regional grid intensity, ported from AI"},{"id":"p31s8","text":"-Carbon-Footprint-Calculator) and per-model latency percentiles.\n- **Surfaces** — the Settings budge"},{"id":"p31s9","text":"t tab (usage bars, per-day usage curve, model breakdown, alerts, cap editors, unblock buttons) and t"},{"id":"p31s10","text":"he `/budget` command (`/budget`, `/budget models`, `/budget unblock <scope>`)."},{"id":"p32s1","text":"## Security boundaries"},{"id":"p33s1","text":"- **No fabrication**: a budget block yields a corrective error finish on the `llm/stream` waterfall "},{"id":"p33s2","text":"— the plugin never invents model output.\n- **No request rewriting**: loop-built requests are frozen;"},{"id":"p33s3","text":" `degrade` therefore names the target model in the corrective message instead of swapping the reques"},{"id":"p33s4","text":"t.\n- **Fail loud**: invalid prices, URLs, ratios, regions, and bounds fail the mount.\n- **Honest sco"},{"id":"p33s5","text":"pe**: runtime edits from the panel are session-scoped; a reload restores the cordis.yml values."},{"id":"p34s1","text":"## Known limitations"},{"id":"p35s1","text":"- Aggregation is process-local: usage resets when the harness restarts (per-day/per-month buckets re"},{"id":"p35s2","text":"build from the current session log view).\n- `block`/`degrade` rely on the `llm/stream` waterfall; ha"},{"id":"p35s3","text":"rness builds without that seam cannot block requests (alerts still work).\n- Built-in prices drift; o"},{"id":"p35s4","text":"verride entries via `config.prices`."}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
